WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.147
Welcome to On-Demand VR. In these activities, you load 3D anatomy models

00:00:05.147 --> 00:00:09.976
in your headset, move them around, and take a photo or a short video to

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:10.620
turn in.

00:00:11.217 --> 00:00:13.945
First, do one thing on a computer.

00:00:13.945 --> 00:00:16.592
Go to xr.optimaed.com and log in.

00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:20.945
Choose Canvas on the left, then click Connect Canvas.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.620
Canvas asks for permission. Click Authorize.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.814
You only have to do this once.

00:00:27.417 --> 00:00:31.095
Now put on your headset, open the Optima app and log in.

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:35.758
Choose the Explore tab, pick any environment you like, and select Begin

00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:36.187
Solo.

00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:40.638
To open your menu, press the top thumb button on your controller.

00:00:40.638 --> 00:00:42.773
Press it again to put the menu away.

00:00:42.773 --> 00:00:46.924
To select something, point at it and pull the trigger under your index

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:47.439
finger.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:50.248
The menu has tabs across the top.

00:00:50.248 --> 00:00:54.612
You will use three of them the most: Models, Canvas and Library.

00:00:55.217 --> 00:00:59.831
Choose Models. The box at the top that says Filter models works like a

00:00:59.831 --> 00:01:03.853
search bar. Select it and type part of a name, like Skeletal.

00:01:03.853 --> 00:01:07.711
Then select the model in the list and choose Spawn Model.

00:01:08.317 --> 00:01:12.503
To grab a model, point at it and squeeze the grip button under your middle

00:01:12.503 --> 00:01:14.482
finger. Move your hand to carry it.

00:01:14.482 --> 00:01:18.329
While you hold it, push the thumbstick left or right to turn it, and

00:01:18.329 --> 00:01:20.013
forward or back to slide it.

00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:23.484
To resize a model, grab it with both grip buttons.

00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:25.778
Pull your hands apart to make it bigger.

00:01:25.778 --> 00:01:28.057
Push them together to make it smaller.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.505
To take a picture, choose the Library tab.

00:01:31.505 --> 00:01:35.925
The camera shows what it sees. Choose Take photo or Record video.

00:01:35.925 --> 00:01:39.016
Everything you capture is saved under Files.

00:01:39.617 --> 00:01:42.127
To turn it in, choose the Canvas tab.

00:01:42.127 --> 00:01:44.570
Check the course and the assignment.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:49.387
Select Choose from My Files, pick your photo, and select Use this file.

00:01:49.387 --> 00:01:51.455
Then select Submit to Canvas.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.287
Back on the computer, the web portal keeps all of your photos and videos

00:01:56.287 --> 00:02:00.583
under My Files. You can download them there, or upload a picture or a PDF

00:02:00.583 --> 00:02:02.036
to use in your headset.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:07.518
Now open the On-Demand VR practice activity and meet the body systems.
